# Original project faction names and descriptions.
ra2-modern-saudi-name = Saudi Arabia
ra2-modern-saudi-description = Expeditionary arms: 13 Saudi units and three defenses. JTAC
    lasers guide armor, artillery and air strikes; the fleet screens
    and replenishes itself. Expensive platforms punish poor positioning.

ra2-r2sang-name = National Guard
ra2-r2sang-description = Durable three-round burst infantry. Deploy to brace: +18% range,
    20% faster fire and 28% less damage, but cannot move.
    Weak vs armor and aircraft.

ra2-r2saat-name = ATGM Team
ra2-r2saat-description = Slow, long-range guided anti-armor missile. Minimum range: 2
    cells.
    Laser-marked targets take extra damage. Weak vs infantry.

ra2-r2sajtac-name = Saudi JTAC
ra2-r2sajtac-description = Laser-marks ground and naval targets for 8 seconds. Only
    Saudi guided weapons deal extra damage to marked targets.
    Detects cloaked units. No direct damage; requires radar.

ra2-r2falcon-name = Falcon One
ra2-r2falcon-description = Elite commando with a suppressed precision double-tap and C4.
    Calls one F-15SA precision strike every 72 seconds.
    Maximum one. Weak vs armor and aircraft.

ra2-r2falcon-strike-name = Falcon Precision Strike
ra2-r2falcon-strike-description = An F-15SA drops a precision bomb on the target.
    Laser-marked targets take heavy extra damage.

ra2-r2m1a2s-name = M1A2S Battle Tank
ra2-r2m1a2s-description = Heavily armored, expensive main battle tank with an accurate
    120 mm gun. Slow; vulnerable to massed anti-armor ambushes.

ra2-r2sads-name = Mobile Air Defense System
ra2-r2sads-description = Radar-guided long-range interceptor with extended sight.
    Cannot attack ground targets. Requires radar.

ra2-r2caesar-name = CAESAR Howitzer
ra2-r2caesar-description = Fast wheeled 155 mm artillery. Minimum range: 4 cells; the
    chassis must turn to fire.
    Laser-guided shells hit marked targets harder. Needs an escort.

ra2-r2bradley-name = Bradley IFV
ra2-r2bradley-description = Tracked carrier for five infantry with a 25 mm cannon and a
    long-reload TOW launcher.
    Light armor; keep it behind the tanks.

ra2-r2f15sa-name = F-15SA Eagle
ra2-r2f15sa-description = Multirole fighter: four air-to-air missiles and two guided
    strike missiles; returns to Airforce Command to rearm.
    Requires Battle Lab.

ra2-r2ah64sa-name = AH-64E Apache
ra2-r2ah64sa-description = Attack helicopter with a chain gun and anti-armor rockets.
    Rockets hit laser-marked targets harder. Vulnerable to anti-air.
    Requires Battle Lab.

ra2-r2sadiq-name = Al Sadiq Fast Interceptor
ra2-r2sadiq-description = Fast patrol craft with a rapid cannon, strong vs boats and light
    targets. Sonar spots submarines. Weak vs heavy ships.

ra2-r2riyadh-name = Al Riyadh Frigate
ra2-r2riyadh-description = Multi-role frigate: naval gun, CIWS anti-air and depth charges.
    Interceptor magazine deflects missiles. Deploy active radar for
    wider sensors and interception; emission reveals the frigate.

ra2-r2jubail-name = Al Jubail Support Ship
ra2-r2jubail-description = Unarmed replenishment ship. Repairs nearby Saudi ships and
    reloads frigate interceptors faster. Requires radar; escort it.

ra2-r2saguard-name = Guard Tower
ra2-r2saguard-description = Machine-gun tower against infantry. Requires power.
    Weak vs armor and aircraft.

ra2-r2sapatriot-name = Patriot Battery
ra2-r2sapatriot-description = Longest-range air defense. Minimum range: 2 cells. Cannot
    attack ground targets. Requires radar and power.

ra2-r2satow-name = TOW Emplacement
ra2-r2satow-description = Guided anti-armor missiles against vehicles and ships.
    Minimum range: 2 cells. Requires radar and power.
